      "message": "musig: declassify the keypair's pubkey in nonce_gen_counter\n\nnonce_gen_counter does not declassify the pubkey it copies from the\nkeypair, though nonce_gen_internal loads it with pubkey_load, which\nARG_CHECKs it, and serializes it. keypair_load declassifies the same\ndata for the same reason. Declassify the copy here too.\n\nctime_tests passed a keypair that was never marked as secret, so it\ncould not see this. It now marks the keypair as undefined before the\ncall. Without the declassify, ctime_tests under valgrind reports 3\nerrors. With it, it reports none.",
